  "body": "Taking full advantage of its elevated, north-facing position, this impressive residence combines generous proportions, quality construction and breathtaking views across the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\nHeld by the current owners since new, this is the first time this much-loved home has been offered to the market, presenting a rare opportunity to secure a property that has been carefully maintained and enjoyed by the same owners throughout its life.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights include:\r\n\r\n* 749sqm freehold site in an elevated, north-facing position\r\n* Breathtaking Hauraki Gulf views\r\n* Five generous bedrooms, including a master with ensuite\r\n* Two bathrooms plus powder room\r\n* Multiple living areas designed for relaxed family living and entertaining\r\n* Approximately 100sqm of concrete decks and patios, creating a seamless connection between the home and outdoors\r\n* Lower-level retreat with kitchenette, ideal for guests, teenagers, extended family or working from home\r\n* Private putting green and striking curved concrete pergola\r\n* North-facing outdoor area prepared for a future swimming pool\r\n* 2.7m stud masonry construction and concrete floors\r\n* Florad underfloor heating and LED lighting\r\n* Fibre connectivity\r\n* Close to Mairangi Bay shops, beaches, cafés and parks\r\n* Zoned for Campbells Bay Primary, Rangitoto College and Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools\r\n\r\nPrivately held from new, beautifully positioned and offering an enviable coastal lifestyle, this is a substantial family home with a rare combination of scale, quality, privacy and outlook\r\n\r\nA home of this calibre and position is best appreciated in person",
